{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-09ae3dfb-b301-450e-aaeb-138c230b4dbd-18\nfc_a798729c-bccd-99fc-9c37-d520f06024f0_4","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"huddle\\.token|auth-|testid|SPA|logout|workspace|modal","path":"/tmp/marathon-4-design.md","caseInsensitive":false,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"call-09ae3dfb-b301-450e-aaeb-138c230b4dbd-18\nfc_a798729c-bccd-99fc-9c37-d520f06024f0_4","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"huddle\\.token|auth-|testid|SPA|logout|workspace|modal","path":"/tmp/marathon-4-design.md","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"../../../../../tmp/marathon-4-design.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":3,"content":"MARATHON-4 adds authenticated profile read and self-update on top of the MARATHON-3 `UserObj` / `users` table: `GET /api/users/{id}` returns a public profile (`200` / `404`), and `PATCH /api/users/me` mutates a validated subset of profile fields (`400` on bad timezone or over-length strings). Successful patches persist in the shared SQLite store (visible on every node) and emit a cluster-wide `user.updated` event through a no-op-safe broadcast hook that MARATHON-18 wires to WebSocket fan-out. This closes the gap between register-time profile defaults and live profile editing the SPA/settings flows need.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":20,"content":"| Require workspace membership to GET a user | Workspaces are MARATHON-5; until then any authenticated user may resolve any `user.id` (global directory) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":26,"content":"Global directory lookup (any authed user → any user id) is simpler than workspace-scoped visibility but leaks existence of all accounts by UUID. Acceptable for this marathon; MARATHON-5+ may tighten visibility later without changing `UserObj` shape.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":89,"content":"**Client (SPA / MARATHON-21–23) while slow/failing:**","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":93,"content":"- On `401`: clear `huddle.token`, show login (same as `/api/auth/me`).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":124,"content":"- On `401`: logout flow.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":207,"content":"| SPA / static UI | MARATHON-21–23 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":226,"content":"| C1 GET user by id | Messages/members UIs; mentions; SPA profile popovers |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":227,"content":"| C2 PATCH `/api/users/me` | SPA settings (MARATHON-23); any client editing status/timezone |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":234,"content":"- **Does not block:** workspace/channel CRUD can proceed; they should embed `UserObj` via `publicUser` when returning members.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":240,"content":"| SPA profile/settings forms + testids | MARATHON-21 / MARATHON-23 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":257,"content":"| SPA auth + settings UI | MARATHON-21–23 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":350,"content":"SPA forms, actual WS client receipt, IRC, workspace member lists.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":13,"totalMatchedLines":13,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-09ae3dfb-b301-450e-aaeb-138c230b4dbd-18\nfc_a798729c-bccd-99fc-9c37-d520f06024f0_4","startedAtMs":"1787428302547","completedAtMs":"1787428304834"},"model_call_id":"4dabf0fb-8eb4-4dfb-98f3-2bbb507fe57f-4-48zp","session_id":"0b561b47-2d17-430d-9c8e-044dfd49fd95","timestamp_ms":1787428304858}
