ic public/ served from GET / on every node; huddle.token + pinned testids; logout is client-only. Handing to review (frontend implementer after architect label cleared). Cross-port localStorage is origin-scoped — not required.\" && loom data show MARATHON-21 --output json | python3 -c 'import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(\"has_design\", d.get(\"has_design\")); print(\"design_len\", len(d.get(\"design\") or \"\")); print(\"status\", d.get(\"status\")); print(\"labels\", d.get(\"labels\")); print(\"assignee\", d.get(\"assignee\")); print(\"design_head\", (d.get(\"design\") or \"\")[:120])'","workingDirectory":"","exitCode":0,"signal":"","stdout":"updated MARATHON-21\nhas_design True\ndesign_len 20221\nstatus in_progress\nlabels ['architect', 'frontend']\nassignee app-architect-1\ndesign_head ## Summary\n\nMARATHON-21 delivers the Huddle browser shell: every HTTP node serves a same-origin SPA at `GET /`, and that\n","stderr":"time=2026-08-22T19:53:33.596Z level=INFO msg=\"opened existing embedded fleet-db client\" url=http://127.0.0.1:38569\n","executionTime":251,"interleavedOutput":"updated MARATHON-21\ntime=2026-08-22T19:53:33.596Z level=INFO msg=\"opened existing embedded fleet-db client\" url=http://127.0.0.1:38569\nhas_design True\ndesign_len 20221\nstatus in_progress\nlabels ['architect', 'frontend']\nassignee app-architect-1\ndesign_head ## Summary\n\nMARATHON-21 delivers the Huddle browser shell: every HTTP node serves a same-origin SPA at `GET /`, and that\n","localExecutionTimeMs":181},"isBackground":false},"description":"Save design on MARATHON-21"},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-9ccbdba8-cdde-4ae2-a89f-b6db6dc59059-25\nfc_5fe50e5d-496c-9598-869e-47dffedabdc7_0","startedAtMs":"1787428413403","completedAtMs":"1787428413654"},"model_call_id":"4dabf0fb-8eb4-4dfb-98f3-2bbb507fe57f-8-ii1s","session_id":"0b561b47-2d17-430d-9c8e-044dfd49fd95","timestamp_ms":1787428413682}
